  "prefLabel": "Rev 1707.08 Report MS-123, Report of Town/City/Village Officials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1707.08 Report MS-123, Report of Town/City/Village Officials.\n\n(a) The MS-123, “Report of Town/City/Village Officials,” is available at the department’s website at https://www.revenue.nh.gov/forms.town-city.htm.\n\n(b) The MS-123 shall be certified and submitted utilizing the MTRSP by the town clerk within 20 days after election or appointment pursuant to RSA 41:19.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1700) #13489, eff 11-15-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1700.html"
